  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_bollard_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>some kind of fur (Veale 226) | good quality skins, probably from Central Russia, which had backs of reddish-brown or very dark grey and white bellies (Veale 227)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
